OL,3,AMurder probe as cyclist dies following
OL,4,Amoped crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder inquiry has begun after an
OL,7,Fe-bike cyclist died following a
OL,8,Fcollision with a moped in west London.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to North
OL,11,FPole Road, North Kensington, at about
OL,12,F01:20 BST on Friday where the seriously
OL,13,Finjured 24-year-old man was found. He
OL,14,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene
OL,15,Fshortly after.
OL,17,FPolice said the investigation was at an
OL,18,Fearly stage but it was believed the
OL,19,Fmoped had been pursuing the e-bike
OL,20,Fcyclist prior to the crash.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
