OL,3,AMurder probe as cyclist dies following
OL,4,Amoped crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDt Ch Insp Neil John said detectives
OL,7,Fwere "pursuing a number of lines of
OL,8,Finquiry, including efforts to identify
OL,9,Fand trace the rider of the moped".
